Evaluation data and model weights

Benchmark instances, queries, corpus documents, repository snapshots, and model
weights remain subject to their upstream terms. The TraceSpec code license does
not relicense those materials.

TraceSpec-Traj contains trajectory-derived evaluation states from
DeepResearch-traj, Nebius SWE-agent trajectories, and the R2E-Gym development
and testing-agent collections. Source identifiers are retained in each state.
The accompanying paper describes the state construction and coverage protocol.
